      "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to the expression $5b-5+t?$",
      "worked_solution": "The expression $5b-5+t$ has three terms:  $5b$, $-5$, and $t.$ \n\nThe order in which we combine the terms doesn't matter. Therefore, we can also write this expression as \n\n$$\nt-5+5b.\n$$",
